in the next couple weeks.

00:53:22.670 --> 00:53:25.060
So you can go visit Jontaffer.com.

00:53:25.060 --> 00:53:27.210
There's great resources out
there for restaurant people.

00:53:27.210 --> 00:53:29.750
Please go to the National
Restaurant Association site.

00:53:29.750 --> 00:53:31.610
They have wonderful COVID information,

00:53:31.610 --> 00:53:33.390
great marketing programs and such.

00:53:33.390 --> 00:53:34.570
There's another organization,

00:53:34.570 --> 00:53:36.830
