00:53:39.130 --> 00:53:42.190
And then, of course, we have our TVT,

00:53:42.190 --> 00:53:44.760
which is about 40 hours
of training content,

00:53:44.760 --> 00:53:46.890
marketing, promotion that
we have that's available

00:53:46.890 --> 00:53:48.360
on our website also.

00:53:48.360 --> 00:53:50.260
My point is this.

00:53:50.260 --> 00:53:51.840
When this pandemic started,

00:53:51.840 --> 00:53:54.540
and I'd like to sort of be
positive here for a minute, Dave.

00:53:54.540 --> 00:53:57.680
When this pandemic started,
I saw people get paralyzed.

00:53:57.680 --> 00:53:58.560
They didn't know what to do.

00:53:58.560 --> 00:54:00.040
They were frozen.

00:54:00.040 --> 00:54:03.590
My second book about excuses,
which we talked about,

00:54:03.590 --> 00:54:05.450
I realized that at this time,

00:54:05.450 --> 00:54:08.020
great marketers are gonna
bubble to the top, aren't they?

00:54:08.020 --> 00:54:09.910
We're gonna see some amazing stuff.

00:54:09.910 --> 00:54:11.820
Great promoters are
gonna bubble to the top.

00:54:11.820 --> 00:54:13.390
We're gonna see great activations,

00:54:13.390 --> 00:54:15.790
and programs, and online events.

00:54:15.790 --> 00:54:18.130
Great operators are
gonna bubble to the top.

00:54:18.130 --> 00:54:20.520
We're gonna see incredible
things happen out there.

00:54:20.520 --> 00:54:24.330
So this is a time to
mobilize, not paralyze.

00:54:24.330 --> 00:54:26.240
This is a time to think
about what it takes

00:54:26.240 --> 00:54:27.450
to bubble to the top.

00:54:27.450 --> 00:54:30.380
Dare I say, those of us who perceive this

00:54:30.380 --> 00:54:34.180
as an opportunity and act upon it,

00:54:34.180 --> 00:54:36.180
can turn this into an opportunity.

00:54:36.180 --> 00:54:38.090
Those of us who freeze,

00:54:38.090 --> 00:54:40.490
who say, ah, this isn't the time,

00:54:40.490 --> 00:54:42.390
I believe we're gonna be left behind.

00:54:42.390 --> 00:54:45.350
This is all up to us, not the pandemic.

00:54:45.350 --> 00:54:46.490
It is up to us.

00:54:46.490 --> 00:54:48.017
Don't let this pandemic be the excuse,

00:54:48.017 --> 00:54:50.100
and we talked about that earlier.

00:54:50.100 --> 00:54:51.810
That's just making yourself feel warm,

00:54:51.810 --> 00:54:54.210
well, it's the pandemic
that caused me to fail.

00:54:54.210 --> 00:54:56.340
And I'm gonna say it, bullshit.

00:54:56.340 --> 00:54:57.440
It's up to us.

00:54:57.440 --> 00:54:58.800
And at a time like this,

00:54:58.800 --> 00:55:00.720
we can figure out how to be successful.

00:55:00.720 --> 00:55:03.360
And a lot of restaurants
are gonna do that.

